本3冊・JOIN用の記録4件・集計用の記録5件を用意しました。

docker compose exec db psql -X -U postgres -d reading_map -P pager=off
psql (18.6 (Debian 18.6-1.pgdg13+2))
Type "help" for help.

reading_map=# SELECT r.book_id, b.title
FROM public.join_records_sample AS r
JOIN public.books_sample AS b ON b.id = r.book_id
ORDER BY r.book_id;

SELECT book_id, count(*) AS read_count
FROM public.aggregate_records_sample
GROUP BY book_id
ORDER BY book_id;
